# Cloudflare static-asset headers. The service worker, the shell and the manifest must be
# revalidated on every load so an update is seen; hashed build output never changes.
# Rules match the request path, so the shell needs `/` as well as `/index.html` (which the
# host redirects to `/`). SPA-fallback routes keep the host default, already
# `max-age=0, must-revalidate`. Matching rules merge, so keep them from overlapping.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
